    "body": "This issue is already done on `upstream/main`.\n\n- PR #1070 (commit `a951eec0`) added `ToolCatalog` (`part_number`, `vendor`, `coating`, `helix_deg`, `notes`) to `Tool` and `ToolDto` as additive optional keys, wired `.camproj` and `.camtools` round-trips, added the Catalog fields to the tool editor UI (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_catalog_rows.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs`, `crates/ui/src/state.rs`), and added them to MCP `add_tool` and `get_job`.\n- PR #1112 (commit `9cb4a5f8`, closing #1063) added catalog fact output to the setup sheet tool list (`crates/app/src/setup_sheet/tools.rs`) and pinned it in `crates/app/tests/setup_sheet.rs::tool_list_prints_stated_catalog_facts_and_omits_unstated`.\n- PR #1086 (commit `b64c08c0`, closing #1062) added MCP `edit_tool` (`crates/app/src/mcp/tool_edit.rs`), pinned in `crates/app/tests/mcp_edit_tool.rs::edit_tool_changes_a_field_and_undo_redo_walk_it`.\n- `.camproj` / `.camtools` round-trip, trimming, undo/redo, and refusals by tool name are pinned in `crates/app/tests/tool_catalog_fields.rs`, `crates/tools/src/catalog_fields.rs::tests::normalizes_and_refuses`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_catalog_rows.rs::tests::the_draft_carries_the_facts_both_ways`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
