    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T23:15:41Z",
    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 31f8d03d7. Source inspection confirms the requested tool catalog fields are present without a new change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nPR #1070 (a951eec03) added part_number, vendor, coating, helix_deg and notes. ToolDto stores them as optional keys. The tool editor exposes all five fields. Existing tests catalog_facts_round_trip_the_project_file and catalog_facts_round_trip_the_tool_library pin persistence. unstated_facts_write_no_keys_and_old_json_loads pins old-file compatibility.\n\nPR #1086 (b64c08c0c) added MCP edit_tool. edit_tool_changes_a_field_and_undo_redo_walk_it pins vendor editing and undo/redo.\n\nPR #1112 (9cb4a5f8b) added catalog facts to the setup sheet. tool_list_prints_stated_catalog_facts_and_omits_unstated pins that output. Free-text notes are deliberately omitted by the existing implementation and test.\n\nThis check inspected upstream source and existing tests. It did not execute tests or a gate. No claim, branch or code change was made. Stopping at Step 1(c).\n",
